  "body": "## Small editorial fix\nIn section 2.1.1, the `nameList` example refers to step 2.1 and step 2.3. It's my assumption that this is meant to be 3.1 and 3.3, to reflect the race condition. I can see there were only 2 steps in previous drafts - so this probably flew under the radar when the definition for `global` was added as the new step 2.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11283/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 5, 2025, 1:24 AM UTC (f83a593)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11283/609285e...f83a593/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 5, 2025, 1:24 AM UTC (f83a593)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11283/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 5, 2025, 1:24 AM UTC (f83a593)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11283/609285e...f83a593/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on May 5, 2025, 1:24 AM UTC (f83a593)\">diff</a> )",
